JoJo may not have been in the driver&#x2019;s seat for her first F1 race last weekend in Austin, but she could have been.

&#x201C;I like to drive fast, bi&#x2014;! I love to go fast,&#x201D; she told Billboard backstage at Proper Presents: Soundtracks with Tommy Hilfiger, a music series held at Austin Proper Hotel in collaboration with the iconic American fashion house ahead of the race. &#x201C;I love to whip a car around,&#x201D; JoJo says. &#x201C;I want to be in that car.&#x201D;

SEE ROOMS & RATES AT PROPER HOTEL AUSTIN

Despite having never attended an F1 race prior to Circuit of the Americas (COTA), the singer says she&#x2019;s done her research, noting that Tommy Hilfiger is the official apparel sponsor for the Cadillac Formula 1 Team, which is making its debut season on the grid. Growing up, JoJo fell in love with Cadillac by way of a friend&#x2019;s family ride, calling it &#x201C;the fanciest car in town. It was just so cool,&#x201D; she says. &#x201C;The fact that Tommy is [working] with Cadillac makes me feel so nostalgic.&#x201D;

