The F1 Austin events over the weekend reflect Tommy Hilfiger&#x2019;s continued investment in the intersection of fashion, art, music, entertainment, and sports, a space the brand has occupied through collaborations and cultural partnerships for more than four decades. Its alliance with the Cadillac Formula 1 Team brings that approach to a sport experiencing a surge in U.S. popularity, pairing the two brands around a shared vision of American style and innovation. Proper Hotels brought its own creative perspective to the weekend through Proper Presents, its signature music series, which is programmed around major cultural moments and citywide events. Together, the partnerships extended the Grand Prix experience beyond the track, connecting racing with the artists, sounds, and cultural conversations shaping the weekend.
